GIVEN circumstances IS A LIST OF `A circumstance of a loss`
      cause         IS A `A cause of loss`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A General Exclusion`
`General Exclusion 7(a) applies to` circumstances `caused by` cause MEANS
    `those that hold among`
        (LIST PAIR `General Exclusion 7(a): loss of or damage to Electronic Data`
                   (    elem `loss, distortion, erasure or alteration of Electronic Data` circumstances
                    AND NOT (    elem `a Defined Peril (fire or explosion) resulting from it caused physical loss` circumstances
                             AND (cause EQUALS `fire` OR cause EQUALS `explosion`))))

-- 7(b). Where an electronic data processing medium insured here suffers insured physical
-- damage, it is valued at the cost of the blank medium plus the cost of copying the
-- Electronic Data from back-up or from originals of a previous generation; not research,
-- engineering or other costs of recreating the data. If the medium is not repaired, replaced
-- or restored, the basis is the cost of the blank medium. Nothing is paid for the value of
-- the data itself, even if it cannot be recreated.
